@startuml BODYLINE_PartState
[*] --> CREATED
CREATED --> IN_PROCESS : body_start
IN_PROCESS --> ACCEPTED : body_complete / valid
IN_PROCESS --> REWORK_WAITING : body_complete / invalid
REWORK_WAITING --> REWORK_IN_PROGRESS : rework_action START
REWORK_IN_PROGRESS --> READY_FOR_REINSPECTION : rework_action COMPLETE
READY_FOR_REINSPECTION --> ACCEPTED : külön újraellenőrzés / megfelelt
READY_FOR_REINSPECTION --> REWORK_WAITING : újraellenőrzés / nem felelt meg
ACCEPTED --> [*]
@enduml
